{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1476","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"彰明美德。前一个“明”是动词，彰明。明德，美好的德行。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"亲近爱抚民众。一说“亲”当作“新”，“新民”即使天下人去旧立新，去恶向善","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"达到道德修养的最高境界","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"知道要达到的“至善”境界，则志向坚定不移","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"心不妄动","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"性情安和","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"思虑精详","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"处事合宜","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"使家族中的各种关系整齐有序","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"获得知识。一说，把自己对事物的认识推到极致","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"推究事物的原理","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"对外物之理认识充分","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"一概，一律。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-9959-13"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"大学之道，在明明德","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-9959-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，在亲民","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-9959-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，在止于至善","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-9959-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。知止而后有定","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-9959-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，定而后能静","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-9959-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，静而后能安","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-9959-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，安而后能虑","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-9959-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，虑而后能得","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-9959-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。物有本末，事有终始，知所先后，则近道矣。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"古之欲明明德于天下者，先治其国。欲治其国者，先齐其家","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-9959-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。欲齐其家者，先修其身。欲修其身者，先正其心。欲正其心者，先诚其意。欲诚其意者，先致其知","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-9959-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。致知在格物","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-9959-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。物格而后知至","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-9959-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，知至而后意诚，意诚而后心正，心正而后身修，身修而后家齐，家齐而后国治，国治而后天下平。自天子以至于庶人，壹是","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-9959-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"皆以修身为本。","type":"text"},{"alt":":confused:","mediaId":"media-5cec2d0c179be608fa78","type":"media-ref"},{"alt":":thinking:","mediaId":"media-05968d07a78127b2884f","type":"media-ref"},{"alt":":pensive_face:","mediaId":"media-699e75bdf8e4073e5b79","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"修齐治平","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《大学之道》强调“修身为本”，提纲挈qiè领地论说“三纲”“八目”的体系。“三纲”即“明明德”“亲民”“止于至善”，“八目”即“格物”“致知”“诚意”“正心”“修身”“齐家”“治国”“平天下”。学习时要结合《大学》中的相关论述，理解“三纲”“八目”的具体所指及其内部关联。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"某於大學用工甚多。溫公作通鑑，言：「臣平生精力，盡在此書。」某於大學亦然。論孟中庸，卻不費力。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"一日，教看大學，曰：「我平生精力盡在此書。先須通此，方可讀書。」","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"去前三日，朱熹仍在孜孜不倦地修订《大学》“诚意”章：“三月辛酉，改《大学》诚意章。甲子，先生卒。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"“儒家哲学，范围广博。概括说起来，其用功所在，可以《论语》‘修己安人’一语括之。其学问最高目的，可以《庄子》‘内圣外王’一语括之。做修己的功夫，做到极处，就是内圣；做安人的功夫，做到极处，就是外王。至于条理次第，以《大学》上说得最简明。《大学》所谓‘格物致知诚意正心修身’，就是修己及内圣的功夫；所谓‘齐家治国平天下’，就是安人及外王的功夫。然则学问分做两橛吗？是又不然。《大学》结束一句‘壹是皆以修身为本’。格致诚正，只是各人完成修身功夫的几个阶级；齐家治国平天下，只是各人以已修之身去齐他治他平他。所以‘自天子以至于庶人’，都适用这种工作。《论语》说‘修己以安人’，加上一个‘以’字，正是将外王学问纳入内圣之中，一切以各人自己为出发点。以现在语解释之，即专注重如何养成健全人格。人格锻炼到精纯，便是内圣；人格扩大到普遍，便是外王。儒家千言万语，各种法门，都不外归结到这一点。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"——见梁启超：《儒家哲学》，4-5页，北京，北京大学出版社，2010。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"子路问君子。子曰: “ 修己以敬。” 曰: “ 如斯而已乎?” 曰: “ 修己以安人。”曰: “如斯而已乎?”曰: “修己以安百姓。修己以安百姓, 尧舜其犹病诸?”———《论语·宪问》","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"节选自《礼记·大学》（《礼记正义》，上海古籍出版社2008 年版）。题目是编者加的。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"大学之道，指穷理、正心、修身、治人的根本原则。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"alt":":paperclip:","mediaId":"media-731be13e40a3e11288a9","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09/5%e8%ae%ba%e8%af%ad%e5%8d%81%e4%ba%8c%e7%ab%a0/%e5%a4%a7%e5%ad%a6%e4%b9%8b%e9%81%93%e7%a4%bc%e8%ae%b0","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09/5%e8%ae%ba%e8%af%ad%e5%8d%81%e4%ba%8c%e7%ab%a0/%e5%a4%a7%e5%ad%a6%e4%b9%8b%e9%81%93%e7%a4%bc%e8%ae%b0","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09/5%e8%ae%ba%e8%af%ad%e5%8d%81%e4%ba%8c%e7%ab%a0/%e5%a4%a7%e5%ad%a6%e4%b9%8b%e9%81%93%e7%a4%bc%e8%ae%b0","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":36974,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/2/27d5022c4a925658b21c69b65e15ace879382193.png","height":1114,"id":"media-64be00ffbdd5bd5e9965","mediaType":"image/png","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07